 :compatibility-deltas
 [{:id :factory/execution-token-abort
   :classification :experimental
   :status :ported
   :upstream-pr 2537
   :evidence [:factory-execution-token-abort]
   :reason
   "The existing experimental Clojure factory runtime already accepts reverse factory.abort requests, so it must honor the required executionToken and isolate concurrent attempts sharing a durable run ID. Factory execute registration and abort cancellation are prepared inline in wire order before bounded worker dispatch, matching Node's synchronous pre-await registration without blocking arbitrary factory work on the protocol reader."
   :clojure-paths
   ["src/github/copilot_sdk/client.clj"
